# field-arrows (M7): b's box (330, 513.5, 107 x 32 at 1440 x 900) clicked, then ↑ twice in its
# field: 1.01, 1.02, each applied at once (a jump) and printed in the field; Esc puts 1.00 back.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
click 383 529
wait 16
key ArrowUp
key ArrowUp
wait 1000
shot nudged
key Escape
wait 1000
shot escaped
